"データをフィットします。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:16 ba275bf6e0874626bb5f50273bd0b545
msgid "ARIMA: Time Series Forecasting"
msgstr "ARIMA: 時系列予測"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:20 01a2b2d2b39d445b91693d2cedf88181
msgid ""
"Model and forecast time series with AR, MA, ARMA, and ARIMA/SARIMAX methods "
"added to `TimeSeries`."
msgstr "`TimeSeries` に追加された AR、MA、ARMA、ARIMA/SARIMAX の手法で時系列をモデル化・予測します。"

